//
//   remote MALAY_SOC/rtl/           this repo (rtl/ips/)        remap applied
//   ------------------------        ---------------------       -------------------------
//   RTL_SOC/rtl/<f>.sv              RTL_SOC/<f>.sv             dropped the rtl/ level
